# Trivy vulnerability allowlist.
#
# Nothing is ignored by default. Every entry added here must be justified: the
# CVE ID, an expiry date to force re-review, and a reason. An allowlist with no
# expiry and no reason is how a scanner gate becomes theater.
#
# Format:
# CVE-2024-XXXXX exp:2026-12-31 -- one-line reason this is accepted for now
